<title>JAPAN: Hanshin Elec Rail - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hanshin Elec Rail - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 39.34		vs	   32.69</p>
<p> Operating	    7.27		vs	    2.54</p>
<p> Current	 prft 1.98		vs    loss 68    million</p>
<p> Net		    1.93		vs	  743    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.63 yen	  vs	    2.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    344 million	  vs	 344 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hanshin Electric Railway Co Ltd operates lines linking Osaka and Kobe.</p>
